T1  - Full-Learning Rotational Quaternion Convolutional Neural Networks and Confluence of Differently Represented Data for PolSAR Land Classification
A1  - Y. Matsumoto
A1  -  R. Natsuaki
A1  -  A. Hirose
Y1  - 2022
