KW  - EPPI-Reviewer, Cell image classification;convolutional neural network (CNN);field-programmable gate array (FPGA);hardware architecture;low-latency inference;multiplexed asymmetric-detection time-stretch optical microscopy (multi-ATOM);quantized convolutional neural network (QCNN);reconfigurable computing
